		"&7a foundation for the reactors ahead."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fChemistry"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Buffer it in a chemical tank so production never stalls."
	]
	quest.038F3BFBD4388A0F.quest_subtitle: "&7A key chemical is flowing"
	quest.038F3BFBD4388A0F.title: "&a&lChemistry Milestone"
	quest.03A1750399F9460E.quest_desc: [
		"&c&lEnter the Nether"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Light an obsidian portal and cross into the Nether,"
		"&7a hostile realm of fire, ash and ancient danger."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fExploration"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Build the portal away from home. Nether mobs can follow you back."
