		"&7a random magical effect that changes over time."
		""
		"&e&lCategory:&r &fEquipment"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A gamble worn on the waist. Some gifts are far better than others."
	]
	quest.088FCB5267CB7A89.quest_subtitle: "&7A belt of random magic"
	quest.088FCB5267CB7A89.title: "&e&lBelt of Unstable Gifts"
	quest.08A17100B055FAE4.quest_desc: [
		"&c&lHunt 700 Slimes"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Bouncing cubes that split into smaller copies."
		"&7Each kill spawns two more to chase you."
		"&7Seven hundred felled, a slayer of legend."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fHostile Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Whittle them down from big to small, mind the rebound."
