		"&d&lTier Installers"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A Tier Installer raises a machine or transfer block to the"
		"&7next tier, basic up to ultimate, without rebuilding it."
		""
		"&d&lCategory:&r &fUpgrades"
		""
