		"&b&lSonic Boom Charm"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft the Sonic Boom Protection Charm. Worn as a curio,"
		"&7it shields you from the Warden deadly sonic attack."
		""
		"&b&lCategory:&r &fEquipment"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7This charm can turn an unwinnable Warden fight into a fair one."
