		"&6&lOcelot Fossil"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Brush the Ocelot Fossil body and skull out of"
		"&7Fossiliferous Dirt. Once assembled, creepers nearby"
		"&7keep their distance, even more than from a live cat."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fFossils"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Stand one near your base entrance to scare creepers off."
	]
	quest.0941952276BB3626.quest_subtitle: "&7A prehistoric cat that creepers fear"
	quest.0941952276BB3626.title: "&6&lOcelot Fossil"
