		"&c&lHunt 10 Witches"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Potion-throwing hags that heal and harm at range."
		"&7They chug potions to shrug off your blows."
		"&7First blood, ten down on the board."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fHostile Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Rush them before they drink, do not let them stall the fight."
