		"&d&lChemical Upgrade"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A Chemical Upgrade lowers how much gas a machine spends on"
		"&7each task, stretching your chemical supply much further."
		""
		"&d&lCategory:&r &fUpgrades"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Great for the purifying and injecting machines that drink gas."
	]
	quest.09830BB2A23E94B4.quest_subtitle: "&7Use less gas per operation"
	quest.09830BB2A23E94B4.title: "&d&lChemical Upgrade"
	quest.0990D6CEE042F44E.quest_desc: [
		"&a&lMagic Map"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft a magic map. It reveals the biomes and the great"
		"&7landmarks of the Twilight Forest around you."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fExploration"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7The magic map marks boss structures. Read it to plan your route."
	]
