		"&6&lMythic Material"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Gather mythic materials, the rarest of them all. They"
		"&7reroll and perfect the affixes of mythic-quality gear."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fMaterials"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Mythic materials are an endgame prize. Hoard every single one."
