		"&b&lNether Concentrate"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A concentrate of blaze, magma, gold and netherite scrap."
		"&7It carries the heat resistance of the Nether itself."
		""
		"&b&lCategory:&r &fBase Materials"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7One farming trip for blaze rods and magma cream covers many crafts."
