		"&5&lChemical Tanks"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Chemical Tanks store gases, slurries and other chemicals."
		"&7Basic up to ultimate, each tier holds far more than the last."
		""
		"&5&lCategory:&r &fStorage"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A buffer tank keeps a chemistry line steady through every surge."
