		"&6&lBasic Circuits and Redstone"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Redstone is the heart of a Basic Control Circuit. Gather"
		"&7both in bulk so machine crafting never stalls."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fControl Circuits"
		""
