		"&c&lHunt 400 Western Gorillas"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Mighty apes that rule the jungle with brute strength."
		"&7A charging silverback is not to be trifled with."
		"&7Four hundred kills, the bodies pile up."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fAnimal Garden"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Come prepared, a gorilla shrugs off blows and hits back hard."
	]
	quest.1D81EC327ECA3E76.quest_subtitle: "&7400 Western Gorillas slain"
	quest.1D81EC327ECA3E76.title: "&c&lHunt 400 Western Gorillas"
