		"&e&lDominion Wand"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft the Dominion Wand. It connects sources, jars and"
		"&7machines so your whole magic network talks together."
		""
		"&e&lCategory:&r &fEquipment"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Essential for automation. Link outputs to inputs with a click."
