		"&a&lFoliaath"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Foliaath is a predatory jungle plant that hides as a"
		"&7sprout, then snaps shut when prey wanders too near."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fCreatures"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Slay five. Kill one for a chance at its music disc, Petiole."
