		"&5&lHunt 900 Possessed Hoglins"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A creature seized by a wandering spirit, hostile and hungry."
		"&7Nine hundred slain, almost complete."
		""
		"&5&lCategory:&r &fOccultism Hunt"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Butcher them and their essence feeds your occult rituals."
	]
	quest.2305F0E3DB91BF0D.quest_subtitle: "&7900 Possessed Hoglins slain"
	quest.2305F0E3DB91BF0D.title: "&5&lHunt 900 Possessed Hoglins"
	quest.230B3C36AE2AD333.quest_desc: [
		"&c&lSkewer Master"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Grill a &fBeef Skewer&7 to perfection and assemble a juicy"
		"&fKebab Sandwich&7. Street food at its finest."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fDish"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Skewers are portable and cheap to mass-produce,"
		"&7making them a great early-game hunger fix."
