		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The casing of the Supercritical Phase Shifter, the multiblock"
		"&7that transmutes polonium into antimatter."
		""
		"&d&lCategory:&r &fSPS and Antimatter"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A large hollow shell, built around a core of supercharged coils."
