		"&b&lThe Blast Furnace"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Build the Blast Furnace from twenty-seven Blast Bricks. Fed"
		"&7iron and coal coke, it forges the Steel that IE runs on."
		""
		"&b&lCategory:&r &fFurnaces and Ovens"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7It also leaves Slag, a handy ingredient for concrete and more."
