		"&9&lRobit"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Robit follows you around, opens as a portable crafting"
		"&7table and inventory, and recharges itself at a Chargepad."
		""
		"&9&lCategory:&r &fEquipment"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Name it and dye it. The Robit is your companion in the field."
