		"&a&lDecorated Pot Sherds II"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Keep brushing for six further decorated pot sherds,"
		"&7their patterns telling of toil, fortune and the daily"
		"&7struggle to survive in ages long past."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fPot Sherds"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Suspicious Dirt and Suspicious Red Sand hide many sherds."
