		"&3&lNeptunium Tools"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Fished up from the sea, Neptunium forges a sword, pickaxe,"
		"&7shovel, axe, hoe, bow and rod. Each one works better under"
		"&7water, from mining with no slowdown to a rod that lures fish."
		""
		"&3&lCategory:&r &fNeptunium"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Neptunium gear even mends itself while you swim with it."
	]
	quest.24A8B8290C45BC2E.quest_subtitle: "&7Tools forged for the deep"
	quest.24A8B8290C45BC2E.title: "&3&lNeptunium Tools"
