		"&6&lTelescope"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Telescope is a bulkier version of the spyglass, fitted"
		"&7to an aircraft so you can scout far ahead while you fly."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fUpgrades and Weapons"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Use it to spot a landing site or danger long before you reach it."
	]
	quest.270E7CBEA7B0C342.quest_subtitle: "&7A bulkier spyglass for the cockpit"
	quest.270E7CBEA7B0C342.title: "&6&lTelescope"
