		"&6&lEmerald Dust"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Gather emerald dust and a bottle of experience. Crushed"
		"&7emerald carries value into the occult alchemy recipes."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fMaterials"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A pulverizer turns whole emeralds into dust. Crush a few."
	]
