		"&e&lAtomic Alloy"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Reinforced Alloy infused with refined obsidian. The top"
		"&7alloy of Mekanism and fuel for quantum level crafts."
		""
		"&e&lCategory:&r &fExternal Resources"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Refined obsidian dust needs both an Enrichment Chamber and a Crusher."
