		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft the Charm of Keeping III. The highest tier: your"
		"&7entire inventory survives a single death."
		""
		"&b&lCategory:&r &fUtility"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7One use only. Craft a fresh charm after each death it saves."
	]
