		"&d&lEnder Inventory Glyph"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Unlock the Ender Inventory Glyph. Glyphs are the words of spellcraft,"
		"&7combined on a spell parchment to script your own spells."
		""
		"&d&lCategory:&r &fGlyphs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Inscribe glyphs at the Scribes Table. Mix forms, effects and augments."
	]
	quest.3A44DCF5B7D5024C.quest_subtitle: "&7The Ender Inventory Glyph, a word of magic"
	quest.3A44DCF5B7D5024C.title: "&d&lEnder Inventory Glyph"
