		"&c&lHunt 700 Wilden Stalkers X"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A ranged Wilden horror that fires spikes from afar."
		"&7A first taste of the hunt."
		"&7Seven hundred, the tally climbs."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fArs Nouveau Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Its wings feed the Wilden Chimera ritual, gather them in numbers."
	]
	quest.3A7B45F8A8354F76.quest_subtitle: "&7700 Wilden Stalkers X slain"
	quest.3A7B45F8A8354F76.title: "&c&lHunt 700 Wilden Stalkers X"
