		"&6&lBasic Induction Cell"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A storage cell for the Induction Matrix, each one adding to the"
		"&7matrix's total energy capacity."
		""
		"&6&lCategory:&r &fInduction Matrix"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Cells set capacity, providers set transfer rate, mix as needed."
