		"&c&lHunt 100 Dolphins"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Playful and clever, they guide sailors to treasure."
		"&7Killing them costs you their friendly boost."
		"&7A hundred kills, a real hunter at last."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fAquatic Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Only hunt if you must, alive they lead you to shipwrecks."
	]
	quest.3FAA5510E08EA8A9.quest_subtitle: "&7100 Dolphins slain"
	quest.3FAA5510E08EA8A9.title: "&c&lHunt 100 Dolphins"
	quest.3FAA65494246E571.quest_desc: [
		"&c&lHunt 800 Zombified Piglins"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A rotting piglin that swarms in fury when one of them is struck."
		"&7Eight hundred slain, few can match this."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fNether Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Fight them one at a time, or the whole horde turns on you."
