		"&7This offer is &arepeatable&7, buy as often as you can afford."
		""
		"&d&lCategory:&r &fHard to Find"
		""
		"&e&lTip:&r &7Earn coins from hunt and progression quests, then spend them here."
	]
	quest.3FE68C15E40E243B.quest_subtitle: "&7Costs &e1x Sprocket&7, repeatable"
	quest.3FE68C15E40E243B.title: "&d&lBuy: Magic Clay"
