		"&7Slower than horses but steady and strong."
		"&7Five hundred slain, half a thousand done."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fPassive Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7They carry your loot, worth taming before a hunt turns wasteful."
	]
	quest.436318F105438352.quest_subtitle: "&7500 Donkeys slain"
	quest.436318F105438352.title: "&c&lHunt 500 Donkeys"
