		"&e&lMolten Steel Bucket"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A bucket of molten steel straight from the TFMG blast"
		"&7furnace. Poured into casings and compounds."
		""
		"&e&lCategory:&r &fExternal Resources"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Keep the blast furnace running, two recipes want this."
