		"&c&lHunt 50 Grottols"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A crystal-backed mole that burrows through stone, feasting on ore."
		"&7Fifty down, a seasoned hunter now."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fMowzie's Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Finish it with a Fortune pickaxe for a much bigger diamond haul."
