		"&5&lHunt 200 Catacombs Zombies"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A rotting undead risen from the catacombs beneath."
		"&7Slow but tireless, they wear down the careless."
		"&7Two hundred gone, your name spreads."
		""
		"&5&lCategory:&r &fIron's Spellbooks"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Fight in the open, they mob you in tight tunnels."
