		"&3&l･❪ Arcane Circuit ❫･"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A circuit etched with Source. It binds Ars Nouveau magic"
		"&7to industrial logic and drives the highest control circuits."
		""
		"&3&lCategory:&r &fAdvanced Components"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7You will need several: one per Elite Control Circuit chain."
