		"&c&lHunt 500 Vindicators"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Axe-wielding raiders that charge with grim silence."
		"&7Their chop cuts through armor in a hurry."
		"&7Five hundred slain, half a thousand done."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fHostile Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Do not let them corner you, their axe hits harder than it looks."
	]
	quest.495F1E820F8BE9EE.quest_subtitle: "&7500 Vindicators slain"
	quest.495F1E820F8BE9EE.title: "&c&lHunt 500 Vindicators"
