		"&c&lHunt 800 Tadpoles"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Tiny swimmers that grow into frogs."
		"&7Fragile now, but full of promise."
		"&7Eight hundred kills, a relentless hunter."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fAquatic Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Scoop them from swamps, temperature decides the frog they become."
	]
