		"&a&lShells and Bowls"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Prepare the serving vessels: a Dragon Egg Shell half and a"
		"&7Shulker Bowl, both used to plate End cuisine."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fIngredients"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7These containers return to you when you finish the meal."
	]
	quest.4B567B9816F0E9FB.quest_subtitle: "&7Vessels for the finest dishes"
	quest.4B567B9816F0E9FB.title: "&a&lShells and Bowls"
	quest.4B5893055DC8E1F6.quest_desc: [
		"&5&lHunt 800 Possessed Endermites"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A creature seized by a wandering spirit, hostile and hungry."
		"&7Eight hundred banished, few can match this."
		""
		"&5&lCategory:&r &fOccultism Hunt"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Butcher them and their essence feeds your occult rituals."
