		"&d&lAncient Totems"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Recover four ancient totems. Torrent dashes you across"
		"&7the land, Souls drains a foe to heal you, Growth speeds"
		"&7nearby crops and Radiance reveals and burns monsters."
		""
		"&d&lCategory:&r &fArtifacts"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Each totem is rare loot. Torrent and Souls are held, the others placed."
