		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Prefer a map? Open your inventory and click the FTB Chunks icon to claim tiles by clicking them."
		""
		"&8&l● Note:&r &8A chunk is a 16x16 block column. Press F3+G to see chunk borders."
	]
