		"&3&l･❪ Thermal Conductor ❫･"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Channels extreme heat out of the reaction chamber. Blaze"
		"&7rods and Nether Concentrate give it its tolerance."
		""
		"&3&lCategory:&r &fAdvanced Components"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Energized Crystals boost conduction, craft a few extra."
