		"&c&lHunt 700 Creepers"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Silent green stalkers that hiss then explode."
		"&7One blast can undo hours of building."
		"&7Seven hundred felled, a slayer of legend."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fHostile Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Hit and step back, never let one detonate against your walls."
