		"&5&lHunt 250 Ender Dragons"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The apex terror of the End, reborn again and again for the truly relentless."
		"&7Two hundred fifty, the hunt endures."
		""
		"&5&lCategory:&r &fEnd Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Respawn it with four end crystals, then knock its own crystals out first."
