		"&e&lCombined Goggles"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft the Combined Goggles. They merge the otherworld"
		"&7vision with extra utility for a true occult engineer."
		""
		"&e&lCategory:&r &fGear"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7The upgraded headgear. Wear them once you go deep into the mod."
