		"&c&lHunt 300 Zoglins"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A hoglin dragged into the Nether too long, now mindless and hostile."
		"&7Three hundred fallen, relentless work."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fNether Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7It attacks everything, lure it away from your build before you strike."
