		"&c&lHunt 100 Shattered"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A broken husk of one lost to the Otherside, growling."
		"&7A hundred slain, a true hunter now."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fOtherside Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7They react to movement, ambush before they call more."
