		"&a&lPressurized Reaction Chamber"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7The Pressurized Reaction Chamber combines a solid, a fluid"
		"&7and a gas in one recipe, the way substrate and HDPE are made."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fChemistry"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7It is the only machine that takes all three inputs together."
