		"&c&lHunt 700 Bats"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Fluttering cave dwellers that dart through the dark."
		"&7Harmless but hard to pin down in flight."
		"&7Seven hundred felled, a slayer of legend."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fPassive Mobs"
		""
