		"&c&lHunt 200 Villagers"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Peaceful townsfolk who trade goods and tend their homes."
		"&7Harmless, but their golems answer for them."
		"&7Two hundred felled, your name spreads."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fVillage Protectors"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Strike one and the whole village turns against you, tread carefully."
