		"&b&lPortstone"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Right-click a Portstone to open the waystone menu and"
		"&7warp away to any discovered destination. You can leave"
		"&7from a portstone, but you can never teleport to one."
		""
		"&b&lCategory:&r &fTeleport Blocks"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Place one as a public departure hub. It comes in sixteen colors."
