		"&c&lHunt 600 Zoglins"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A hoglin dragged into the Nether too long, now mindless and hostile."
		"&7Six hundred, the hunt never ends."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fNether Mobs"
		""
