		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Tusked beasts of the crimson forest that charge and toss you."
		"&7A source of much-needed Nether meat."
		"&7Six hundred, the hunt never ends."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fNether Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Keep warped fungi handy, it repels them when things go wrong."
	]
	quest.73BF747B2690371C.quest_subtitle: "&7600 Hoglins slain"
	quest.73BF747B2690371C.title: "&c&lHunt 600 Hoglins"
	quest.73BFF107295FC236.quest_desc: [
