		"&5&lHunt 700 Shulkers"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7An armored shell of the End cities that fires levitation shots."
		"&7Seven hundred, the tally climbs."
		""
		"&5&lCategory:&r &fEnd Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Its shells drop shulker plates, hunt them across every end ship."
