		"&c&lHunt 900 Skeleton Horses"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Bony steeds that appear amid lightning traps."
		"&7Fast and eerie, a spectral mount of storms."
		"&7Nine hundred dead, the thousand looms."
