		"&a&lElectrolytic Separator"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Runs power through a chemical to split it, water into hydrogen"
		"&7and oxygen, or brine into sodium and chlorine."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fChemistry"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Feed it clean water to make the hydrogen your reactors will burn."
