		"&a&lSmithing Table"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Craft a smithing table. Apotheosis uses it to socket"
		"&7gems into your gear and to apply many of its upgrades."
		""
		"&a&lCategory:&r &fStations"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A simple block, but the socketing process runs through it."
