		"&b&lTop-Tier Shelves"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7Gather the finest shelves: soul touched sculkshelf,"
		"&7echoing sculkshelf, draconic endshelf, geode and treasure shelf."
		""
		"&b&lCategory:&r &fEnchanting Shelf"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7A complete endgame collection. With these, every enchant is open."
