		"&c&lHunt 900 Wilden Hunters XI"
		"&8&m                            "
		""
		"&7A swift Wilden beast that lunges and claws from the wilds."
		"&7A first taste of the hunt."
		"&7Nine hundred, almost complete."
		""
		"&c&lCategory:&r &fArs Nouveau Mobs"
		""
		"&e&l★ Tip:&r &7Its horns and spikes are Chimera reagents, keep hunting them."
	]
	quest.7E587E391C72C20B.quest_subtitle: "&7900 Wilden Hunters XI slain"
	quest.7E587E391C72C20B.title: "&c&lHunt 900 Wilden Hunters XI"
